   "title": "",
   "content": {
    "tg": {
     "text": "<b>{Имя}, hi! You are registered for the \"Spreadsheet Automation Workshop\"</b>\n\n🗓 <tg-time unix=\"{webinar.unix}\">17 September</tg-time>\n⏰ 11:00 MSK\n\n<b>What we will build together:</b>\n• a report that refreshes itself every morning without a single manual copy-paste;\n• a data-cleaning macro that fixes dates, duplicates and broken phone numbers in one click;\n• an approval workflow driven only by cell comments and a status column;\n• a dashboard that stays readable when the data grows from 200 to 20 000 rows;\n• a short checklist for deciding what is worth automating and what is not.\n• a quick way to find the one slow formula that makes the whole workbook crawl;\n• a naming and colour convention that lets a colleague open your file and understand it in a minute;\n• a safe way to share a workbook so that nobody overwrites the formulas by accident.\n\n<b>Gifts waiting for you in the private channel:</b>\n🎁 <b>\"Formula cheat-sheet\"</b>\nOne printable page with the 25 formulas that cover 90% of everyday spreadsheet work.\n🎁 <b>\"Template pack\"</b>\nFive ready-made workbooks: budget, content plan, lead tracker, inventory and weekly report, each with sample data and notes on how to adapt it.\n",
